<title>UK: SmithKline Beecham sets $200 mln 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>SmithKline Beecham sets $200 mln 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SMITHKLINE BEECHAM CAPITAL PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SMITHKLINE BEECHAM PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    28.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.884    PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.275     REOFFER    99.884    SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-50   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
